      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want to go to the doctor if i dont have to, it's such a hassle and expensive. the blisters aren't even that big. if i just put on a thick layer of antibiotic ointment and wrap it up tight, won't that help it heal faster and keep the air off it? it feels like the air makes the stinging worse.",
