    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm just really nervous about going in. if i just use a lot of that antibiotic cream and maybe some heavy-duty aloe vera, can't i just manage it myself? i feel like if i keep it covered and moist it'll just heal up on its own by tomorrow. can't i just wait a day and see if the redness goes down before i decide to go to urgent care?",
